      "source": "reference/sandbox/escalation.ts:22-41,149-178",
      "conclusion": "Faithful constant vocabulary and current-call widening relation. Ten vectors include all nine supported mode pairs plus one unsupported target. Same-mode is a helper no-ask return, never CVG execution authority.",
      "knownBadDiscrimination": "LADDER-05 guards global-default target starvation; mode vectors and LADDER-03/04 distinguish same/narrower from widening.",
      "futureOnly": "Mounted schema and CVG public boundary are explicitly unverified; no name mapping to CVG containment."
    },
